  "title": "Bacon-Wrapped \"Caramel\" Corn on the Cob",
  "description": "For this bacon-wrapped \"caramel\" corn on the cob recipe, fresh corn is coated with butter and sugar, wrapped in bacon, and grilled until decadent.",
  "authors": [
    "Tammi"
  ],
